  <h2>What does done-for-you chiropractic marketing include?</h2>
  <p class="answer-first">
    The ChiroCandy Done-For-You program provides complete, multi-channel marketing execution managed by specialized healthcare media buyers and strategists.
  </p>
  <p>
    We handle creative production, digital ad placement across Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, and Google Ads, organic local SEO optimization, high-converting landing pages, and 24/7 automated lead nurturing via text and email. Every element is configured to turn local searchers and social media users into scheduled appointments on your clinic calendar.
  </p>

  <h2>5 core deliverables of the Done-For-You program</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>
      <strong>Paid Advertising Management:</strong> Custom video and image ad campaigns on Meta (Facebook &amp; Instagram), Google Search, and TikTok targeted to prospective patients in your local radius.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Local SEO &amp; AI Search Authority:</strong> Continuous optimization of your Google Business Profile, local directory citations, and website schema to capture top-3 map pack rankings and AI answer engine citations.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>24/7 Rapid Lead Follow-Up:</strong> Automated SMS and email sequences that contact new patient leads within 60 seconds, answering questions, qualifying intent, and booking appointments directly into your EHR or scheduling software.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Dormant Patient Reactivation:</strong> Periodic automated reactivation campaigns deployed to your historical patient database, bringing past patients back onto your active adjustment schedule.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Dedicated Client Success Manager &amp; Monthly Reporting:</strong> Transparent performance dashboards tracking cost-per-lead, show rate, patient acquisition cost, and estimated return on ad spend (ROAS).
    </li>
  </ol>

  <h2>How is this different from the Training Program?</h2>
  <p class="answer-first">
    In Done-For-You, ChiroCandy builds, executes, and optimizes the marketing campaigns for you. In our <a href="/training-program/">Training Program</a>, we coach and guide your in-house staff to execute these systems themselves.
  </p>
  <p>
    Done-For-You is ideal for high-volume practice owners and solo practitioners who want predictable growth without spending 10+ hours per week managing ads, writing copy, and configuring marketing software. You own the patient records and ad accounts; we manage the day-to-day execution.
  </p>

  <h2>Who is the Done-For-You program built for?</h2>
  <p>
    This program is designed for established chiropractic practices, multi-doctor wellness clinics, and ambitious clinic owners seeking to consistently add 20 to 50+ qualified new patients each month. Whether you specialize in subluxation-based care, functional neurology, pediatric chiropractic, decompression, or sports rehab, our campaigns are tailored to your clinical philosophy and local demographics.
  </p>

  <h2>Frequently asked questions about Done-For-You marketing</h2>
  <h3>How fast do campaigns go live?</h3>
  <p>
    Following your onboarding kickoff and practice intake session, custom campaign creative, ad copy, landing pages, and follow-up automations are built and launched within 10 to 14 business days.
  </p>

  <h3>Do I need to sign a long-term contract?</h3>
  <p>
    No. We operate on an initial 60-day setup and optimization foundation, transitioning to month-to-month service agreements thereafter. We earn your business every month through transparent reporting and tangible patient volume.
  </p>

  <h3>How do we get started?</h3>
  <p>
    Start by scheduling a complimentary practice growth strategy session. We review your current patient acquisition channels, analyze local competitor visibility, and determine whether the Done-For-You program is the right fit for your goals.
  </p>
